@startuml
title D-05 Fiscal Issuance Exception Review Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Operator
actor Supervisor
participant "Operator Console" as Console
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Site POS Server" as POS
participant "Exception / Reconciliation Workflow" as Exception

Central -> POS : request Sales Invoice issuance
POS --> Central : pending / failed / timeout
Central -> Exception : create fiscal exception
Operator -> Console : open fiscal exception
Console -> Central : retrieve payment, fiscal,\nand ExitAuthorization context
Central --> Console : payment received,\nfiscal pending, exit pending
Supervisor -> Console : review / escalate
Console -> Exception : add incident, audit,\nreconciliation context
Exception -> POS : retry / recovery handled\nby approved backend flow

note over Console
Console reviews and escalates.
It does not issue Sales Invoices,
mutate fiscal records, or issue ExitAuthorization.
end note

@enduml
